const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"先理解制度，再套用模型",en:"Institutions before imported models"},body:{zh:"Carpenter与Whitelaw解释为何研究中国股市不能只移植美国市场的常见假设。股票市场同时涉及国企改革、上市选择与资本配置，企业目标和投资者约束未必与已有模型一致。文章的价值是提出研究问题的背景，而不是给市场打一个效率总分。",en:"Carpenter and Whitelaw explain why familiar US-market assumptions may not transfer to China. SOE reform, listing selection and capital allocation interact with different objectives and constraints. The review frames research questions rather than assigning the market a single efficiency score."}},{title:{zh:"这是2017年的文献综述",en:"A review published in 2017"},body:{zh:"文章梳理公司金融与资产定价文献，并以当时的制度演进组织讨论，没有一个可以概括全文的统一回归样本。引言中的规模与制度描述对应其写作时期；阅读时应将其视为历史背景，不能把2017年的规则表述直接当成今天的规则。",en:"This review organizes corporate-finance and asset-pricing studies around institutional development; there is no single pooled regression sample for the article. Market sizes and rules in its introduction belong to its historical setting, not automatically to the present."},reference:{url:"https://pages.stern.nyu.edu/~jcarpen0/pdfs/Carpenter%20Whitelaw%202017%20ARFE%20-%20The%20Development%20of%20China's%20Stock%20Market%20and%20Stakes%20for%20the%20Global%20Economy.pdf",label:{zh:"原文摘要与第1节：综述范围",en:"Original abstract and §1: review scope"}}},{title:{zh:"公司侧：上市与所有权选择",en:"Corporate side: listing and ownership"},body:{zh:"第2节从部分私有化、IPO和上市选择展开。文章比较不同研究对产权变化与企业表现的发现，并提醒国企还可能承担就业、社会与战略目标。因此，上市公司不一定代表全部企业，单个利润指标也未必覆盖改革的全部目标。",en:"Section 2 examines partial privatization, IPOs and listing choice. It contrasts findings on ownership and performance and notes SOEs' employment, social and strategic roles. Listed firms need not represent all firms, and a single profitability measure need not capture every reform objective."},reference:{url:"https://pages.stern.nyu.edu/~jcarpen0/pdfs/Carpenter%20Whitelaw%202017%20ARFE%20-%20The%20Development%20of%20China's%20Stock%20Market%20and%20Stakes%20for%20the%20Global%20Economy.pdf",label:{zh:"原文第2节，尤其第2.1节",en:"Original §2, especially §2.1"}}},{title:{zh:"价格侧：分割与信息含量",en:"Pricing side: segmentation and information"},body:{zh:"引言归纳了A股与境外股份价差、公司特定信息进入价格，以及收益横截面等研究线索。价格差异可能同时涉及信息、可投资范围与市场分割，不能看到价差就认定存在可执行套利；价格波动大也不等于没有公司信息。",en:"The introduction maps work on A-share versus foreign-share premiums, firm-specific price information and the return cross-section. Information and investment constraints can coexist with segmentation. A price gap is not proof of executable arbitrage, and volatility alone is not proof of absent information."}},{title:{zh:"如何使用这篇综述",en:"How to use this review"},body:{zh:"建议先选一个问题，例如股权改革如何改变企业行为，再沿第2节追到被引用的原始研究。分别记录每篇的政策时期、处理对象、对照样本与结果变量。综述适合建立地图；若要引用具体效果大小或因果结论，仍需回到对应论文核对。",en:"Choose a question—such as how ownership reform changes firm behavior—then follow the review to original studies. Record policy periods, treated units, comparison groups and outcomes. A review supplies a map; effect sizes and causal claims still require checking the cited originals."}},{title:{zh:"数据准备从历史身份开始",en:"Start with historical identities"},body:{zh:"编辑建议：证券代码之外，还需保留上市板块、股份类别、所有权和资格规则的生效时间。用今天的公司主表回填过去，会抹去改革和样本选择。若研究涉及跨市场比较，还要明确币种、交易日历与可交易限制，不能仅按同名公司连接两列价格。",en:"Editorial application: preserve dated board membership, share class, ownership and eligibility alongside identifiers. Today's company master can erase historical selection and reform changes. Cross-market comparisons additionally need currency, calendars and trading constraints, not just matching company names."}}],readerLimits:{zh:"这是一张历史研究地图；当前制度、原始论文的识别假设和可获得数据需分别核对。",en:"This is a historical research map. Current institutions, original studies' identification assumptions and available data require separate checks."}};export{e as default};
